			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Tier 1 · 1 Action · Range 6.</strong></p><p><strong>Damage:</strong> 3d4, Vicious. On hit: target is Slowed, 1 turn, and the spell chains to a second target of your choice in Range of the first. An enemy takes equal damage and is Slowed, 1 turn; an ally gains temp HP equal to half the damage and is not Slowed.</p>",
